# Pairs with EveryLinkLands. A parked link that is dropped leaves its split unlinked for good.
MODULE: DeferredLinkDropped
TARGET: EveryLinkLands
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the root drains a parked link by discarding it
PERTURBS: RootDrainDeferred

--- FIND
    /\ ch[o] = "deferred"
    /\ lg = "none"
    /\ ch' = [ch EXCEPT ![o] = "root"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ ch[o] = "deferred"
    /\ lg = "none"
    \* MUTATION: the parked link is discarded
    /\ ch' = [ch EXCEPT ![o] = "done"]
--- END
